flowchart TD
    Client["前端客户端(Vue 3)"] -->|HTTP请求| APIGateway["API网关(Spring Cloud Gateway)"]
    APIGateway -->|路由转发| UserController["用户控制器(LoginController/CreateUserController等)"]
    APIGateway -->|路由转发| PlayerController["玩家控制器(GetPlayerController/GetPlayerStatisticsController等)"]
    APIGateway -->|路由转发| ForumController["论坛控制器(PostController/CommentController等)"]
    
    UserController -->|调用用例| UserUseCases["用户用例(LoginUseCase/CreateUserUseCase等)"]
    PlayerController -->|调用用例| PlayerUseCases["玩家用例(GetPlayerUseCase/GetPlayerStatisticsUseCase等)"]
    ForumController -->|调用用例| ForumUseCases["论坛用例(CreatePostUseCase/AddCommentUseCase等)"]
    
    UserController -->|返回响应| ApiResponse["统一响应格式(ApiResponse)"]
    PlayerController -->|返回响应| ApiResponse
    ForumController -->|返回响应| ApiResponse
    
    ApiResponse -->|JSON数据| Client
    
    subgraph 控制层
        UserController
        PlayerController
        ForumController
        ApiResponse
    end
    
    subgraph 应用层
        UserUseCases
        PlayerUseCases
        ForumUseCases
    end
